{"a":[1,1],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>Bu Fecir sûresi mekkîdir. Ebu hayyan Bahirde mekkî olması cumhur kavli olup Âliy ibni Talhanın medenî dediğini de kaydeylemiştir.</p><p>Âyetleri - Hicazîde otuz iki, Küfî ve Şamîde otuz, Basrîde yirmi dokuzdur.</p><p>Fasılası -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"150\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 150.3 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.2 19.6 34.7 44.8 51.0 61.3 67.6 77.6 87.2 97.6 112.7 129.7\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"123.0 140.0\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21215\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> harfleridir. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 97.8 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.3 13.3 19.6 19.6 25.6 44.8 55.1 65.2 65.2 71.4 77.6 83.9\" y=\"23.3 23.3 24.3 23.3 23.3 23.3 23.3 23.3 23.3 24.3 23.3 23.3 23.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » fasılalarında «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"19\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 18.7 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.2\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » redîf olduğundan asıl fasıla harfi «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"19\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 18.7 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.2\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » sayılmışt r. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"323\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 323.3 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 11.2 17.4 23.4 29.6 35.9 42.1 48.1 54.4 60.6 66.6 72.8 79.1 85.1 91.3 91.3 102.4 109.1 116.0 130.2 130.2 140.0 140.0 148.2 148.2 159.0 166.0 172.9 187.1 187.1 193.3 193.3 193.3 199.6 206.3 220.7 220.7 228.8 235.1 241.3 247.3 253.6 259.8 266.0 272.0 278.3 284.5 290.5 296.8 302.8 313.8 313.8\" y=\"23.8 24.3 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 24.3 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 24.3 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 24.3 23.8 23.8 18.7 23.8 23.8 23.8 24.3 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 23.8 24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><t